# Designed flow; arrows show order/guards, not checked temporal guarantees.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Search root field\nworkspace:read before inspection" {class: start}
Reserve: "Validate + reserve per root\nRoot / policy / stop records\nMatch slots have separate room"
Admission: "Five generic app defaults or supplied roots\nCoreServices + Cryptex + checked .app links\nFile default: Koine home; no link traversal"
Skip: "Blocked / unsupported / absent\nExact target + reason; no consent probe\nOptional default absence: empty domain"
Scan: "Rotate roots + four streams per root\n64 entries per turn; bounded FIFO frontier\nNo root spends another root's credits"
Bounds: "Entry / frontier / diagnostic / path / time bounds\nKeep previous diagnostics; stop has REMAINDER\nNative blocking can prevent later turns"
Coverage: "One coverage object per root\nCOMPLETE → searched SUBTREE\nProgress otherwise → OBSERVED_DESCENDANTS"
Groups: "CHILD_GROUP: count anchors at parent\nDESCENDANT_GROUP: intrinsic anchors under root\nNeither means all children were skipped"
Available: "Any progress → AVAILABLE\nRanked matches; truncation ≠ coverage\nFixed match slots preserve diagnostic room"
Blocked: "No progress, no real failure + prompt risk\nBLOCKED; matches null, coverage survives\nTransport awaits separate design"
Other: "No progress: real failure → FAILED first\nPure absence / exclusion → dependency\nNo invented permission absence"
Publish: "Publish under live read authority\nInspect status, scopes, counts AND errors\nDefault/native coverage + baseline acceptance pending"
Start -> Reserve: "1 · valid input"
Reserve -> Admission: "2 · owned budgets"
Admission -> Skip: "3 · refused scope"
Admission -> Scan: "3 · admitted names"
Scan -> Bounds: "4 · unfinished work"
Skip -> Coverage: "5 · diagnostic only"
Scan -> Coverage: "5 · EOF / observations"
Bounds -> Coverage: "5 · frozen remainder"
Coverage -> Groups: "6 · exact extent semantics"
Groups -> Available: "7 · some progress"
Groups -> Blocked: "7 · prompt risk, no failure"
Groups -> Other: "7 · other no-progress causes"
Available -> Publish: "8 · matches + coverage"
Blocked -> Publish: "8 · no list"
Other -> Publish: "8 · distinct outcome"
